  "description": "\"Is your common sense really up to date?\n\n“You should know this.”\n“I’ve heard of it somewhere.”\nEven knowledge that seems familiar can be surprisingly hard to answer,\nor may turn out to be based on assumptions.\n\nThis game is an extremely challenging common-sense quiz\ncovering a wide range of knowledge.\n\nWord meanings, social knowledge, trivia, culture, and history.\nQuestions that seem familiar but are harder than expected,\nas well as tricky problems that make you stop and think,\nare presented in quiz form.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the question  \n・Choose the answer by intuition  \n・Understand instantly with the result and explanation  \n\nEven if you answer correctly, you can’t relax.\nEven if you’re wrong, every question offers an “aha!” moment.\n\nPlay one question at a time whenever you like.\nPerfect for passing time or checking your knowledge.\n\nHow far does your common sense go?\n\nTake it seriously\nand challenge this extremely difficult common-sense quiz!\n\nーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー\nTT supports game streaming by video creators.\nBoth individuals and organisations can stream this game without obtaining permission from TT.\"",
